<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Master Coach</title>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: #e8dcf2;
    background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6eff9 0%, #dcd0ec 100%);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }
  .document-container {
    width: 850px;
    display: flex;
    position: relative;
  }
  .left-sidebar {
    width: 320px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }
  .title-group {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .title-line {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .highlight-box {
    background-color: #ffde59;
    border: 2px solid #111;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #111;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .vertical-watermark {
    position: absolute;
    left: -20px;
    top: 420px;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: mixed;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .main-content {
    flex-grow: 1;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }
  .section-header {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: #ffde59;
    border-radius: 25px;
    padding: 5px 20px 5px 5px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .section-number {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-right: 12px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #111;
  }
  .bullet-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .bullet-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .bullet-icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-right: 12px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .bullet-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #222;
  }

  /* Section Colors */
  .sec-1 .section-number, .sec-1 .bullet-icon { background-color: #e53935; }
  .sec-2 .section-number, .sec-2 .bullet-icon { background-color: #f57c00; }
  .sec-3 .section-number, .sec-3 .bullet-icon { background-color: #fbc02d; }
  .sec-4 .section-number, .sec-4 .bullet-icon { background-color: #43a047; }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="document-container">
  <div class="left-sidebar">
    <div class="title-group">
      <div class="title-line"><span class="highlight-box">Master</span></div>
      <div class="title-line"><span class="highlight-box">Coach</span></div>
      <div class="title-line"><span class="highlight-box">业界高手，</span></div>
      <div class="title-line"><span class="highlight-box">他们的五项</span></div>
      <div class="title-line"><span class="highlight-box">技能</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="vertical-watermark">ZONG HENG SI HAI</div>
  </div>

  <div class="main-content">
    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <div class="section sec-1">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">1</div>
        <div class="section-title">知识矩阵</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bullet-list">
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">从各个角度思考，推演出无穷无尽的点</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">是一种神秘的混合物，包含了技术上的知识、策略、经验</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">能信手拈来，判断理解学生的进度，接下来应该朝哪些方向努力</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">这是「教」的知识矩阵，属于伯乐独有的心理表征，而不是「做」的知识矩阵。教学是一项区别于亲身实践的独立技能。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <div class="section sec-2">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">2</div>
        <div class="section-title">洞察力</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bullet-list">
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">著名的篮球教练John Wooden，对一些球员大多是表扬，对另一些球员则主要是批评</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">Wooden认为，每一位球员的身高、体重、背景、智力、才能，都不一样，每一位球员都需要区别对待</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">好的教练必须拥有对他人（而不仅仅是对自己）极高的洞察力，才能因材施教</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <div class="section sec-3">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">3</div>
        <div class="section-title">简洁的指示</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bullet-list">
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">John Wooden的话很少超过20秒；动作示范才3秒</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">在记录的2326次教学行为中，仅6.9%是表扬，6.6%是批评。75%是纯粹的信息：该啥样，怎么做，何时强化</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">示范使用总分总：先看整体如何，再拆解（或演示错误的做法），再整体</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">这对表达能力是很高的要求</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <div class="section sec-4">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-number">4</div>
        <div class="section-title">个人魅力</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bullet-list">
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">天才的早期老师，大多不是业界高手，但天才会被他们学习长达5-6年的时间</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">他们是那种孩子喜欢的老师，人和蔼可亲，对孩子鼓励，给孩子糖果，赞扬孩子等</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">万事开头难，一开始处处都在出错，重点是把这件事变得令人向往，愉快，能坚持，有所回报</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet-item">
          <div class="bullet-icon">★</div>
          <div class="bullet-text">教练必须拥有共情力，有个人魅力，牢牢吸住学生</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
